[{:db/id "823bacc4-fbf4-5389-a64d-7f110af210f1" :answer/id #uuid "823bacc4-fbf4-5389-a64d-7f110af210f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{\\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b1908ef3-9a59-519b-acc4-937544a98115" :answer/id #uuid "b1908ef3-9a59-519b-acc4-937544a98115" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{4 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 4 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f88eedc9-9582-51d0-8e93-1d4dc39010e6" :answer/id #uuid "f88eedc9-9582-51d0-8e93-1d4dc39010e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}2 \\sqrt{\\frac{5 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)}}{2} - 4 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + 8}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e690a093-9d6e-5e96-b42b-b1e6a10c7b97" :answer/id #uuid "e690a093-9d6e-5e96-b42b-b1e6a10c7b97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{5 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "da996d42-8849-55ec-90c9-24d03293b7da" :answer/id #uuid "da996d42-8849-55ec-90c9-24d03293b7da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{4 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 2 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c0aa5001-4107-5eed-9d7a-c928d1a5af00" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0aa5001-4107-5eed-9d7a-c928d1a5af00" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["823bacc4-fbf4-5389-a64d-7f110af210f1" "b1908ef3-9a59-519b-acc4-937544a98115" "f88eedc9-9582-51d0-8e93-1d4dc39010e6" "e690a093-9d6e-5e96-b42b-b1e6a10c7b97" "da996d42-8849-55ec-90c9-24d03293b7da"] :answer-field/correct "e690a093-9d6e-5e96-b42b-b1e6a10c7b97" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "3d087f2d-2ebd-593b-99f4-2f7d8b955fc6" :question/id #uuid "3d087f2d-2ebd-593b-99f4-2f7d8b955fc6" :question/problem "Which of the following gives the length of the curve defined by the parametric equations\n$x=2 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)},\\,y=4 t + \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}$\nfrom $t=-1$ to $t=1$?" :question/worked-solution "To compute the arc length $L$ of a parametrically defined curve, we use the formula\n\n$$\nL=\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\right)^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.\n$$\n\nComputing the derivatives of $x$ and $y,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t}=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\left(2 \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}\\right)=- 2 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}t}=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\left(4 t + \\cos{\\left(t \\right)}\\right)=4 - \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}.\n$$\n\nWe substitute these derivatives in the formula for arc length, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L&=\\int_{t_1}^{t_2}\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\right)^2+\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\right)^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &=\\int_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{\\left(- 2 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}\\right)^2+\\left(4 - \\sin{\\left(t \\right)}\\right)^2}\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &=\\int_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{4\\sin^2(t)+16-8\\sin(t)+\\sin^2(t)}\\,\\mathrm{d}t \\\\ &=\\int_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{5 \\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 8 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["c0aa5001-4107-5eed-9d7a-c928d1a5af00"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "1bbdcba2-43d5-5f97-ba9a-abe6720ab953" :answer/id #uuid "1bbdcba2-43d5-5f97-ba9a-abe6720ab953" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\int_{-1}^{1}\\sqrt{\\sin^{2}{\\left(t \\right)} - 10 \\sin{\\left(t \\right)} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}t" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2a7f0612-5fd7-52ee-a70e-130a3ff03c98" :answer/id #uuid "2a7f0612-5fd7-52ee-a70e-130a3ff03c98" :answer/type :answer.type/math